# FORLORN HOPE: the map is sound and at full scale: one massive map of 190 x
# 170 tiles, one base and one waystone pad, three plates (yellow, green and
# blue blocks), four thorn hearts, fifteen keys, seven doors, three gulpers,
# every one of the seventeen kinds of foe (oozles, midges and hornets come out
# of the drains, combs and bells on the map), well over 80 foes placed, and
# the art loads.
game forlorn
cheat start 1
wait 5
expect map_bad == 0
expect kinds == 17
expect hearts == 4
expect keys_total == 15
expect doors_total == 7
expect drains >= 10
expect combs >= 4
expect foes >= 85
expect alive17 == 3
expect art_ok == 1
expect bot_plans == 21
# the corners: the bottom right is rock, the map's edges are walls
expect solid169189 == 1
expect solid40000 == 1
expect solid100000 == 1
